'''Loadouts''' are a system that allow the player to customize their builds. It includes the functionality to swap between one's equipped [[Armor]], [[Equipment]], summoned [[Pets]], {{Item|Heart of the Mountain|text=HotM}} and {{Item|Heart of the Forest|text=HotF}} trees, and selected [[Accessory Power]] and [[Maxwell|{{Gold|Tuning Points}}]] distribution. It can be accessed via {{Code|/loadout}}, {{Code|/loadouts}}, and {{Code|/ld}}.

== Overview ==
Players can customize their '''Loadouts''' to match the playstyle they desire. This includes their:
* [[Wardrobe|Armor Wardrobe]] Slot ([[Helmet]], [[Chestplate]], [[Leggings]], [[Boots]])
* [[Equipment Wardrobe]] Slot ([[Necklace]], [[Cloak]], [[Belt]], [[Gloves]]/[[Bracelet]])
* [[Pet]]
* {{Item|Heart of the Mountain}} Tree
* {{Item|Heart of the Forest}} Tree
* [[Power Stone]]
* [[Maxwell|{{Gold|Tuning Template}}]]

There is a {{Green|10m}} cooldown between swapping {{Item|Heart of the Mountain|text=HotM}} and {{Item|Heart of the Forest|text=HotF}} trees. This cooldown does not apply to any other items affected by swapping a Loadout: however, if the player selects a Loadout that changes their HotM tree, the cooldown will still apply.{{Confirm}}

